    },
    {
        "user": "UGWUJUZHT",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1732400056.579209",
        "client_msg_id": "4ac0e4fc-1682-4c7e-bb05-64e83895af6e",
        "text": "Yes. EE dealt mostly with analogue. Then, a portion of EE swung to the other extreme with digital. Maybe we need a middle ground mix of both?",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1732282516.219939",
        "parent_user_id": "U05SU27S1M2",
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
                "block_id": "4Pix+",
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Yes. EE dealt mostly with analogue. Then, a portion of EE swung to the other extreme with digital. Maybe we need a middle ground mix of both?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "user": "U05SU27S1M2",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1732406827.521019",
        "client_msg_id": "b4d3ca00-c6c8-478e-a9e7-009171bc66b4",
        "text": "Yes agreed, I think you can't really have one without the other so analogue people are in denial of the digital and vice-versa",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1732282516.219939",
        "parent_user_id": "U05SU27S1M2",
        "blocks": [
